{"channelId":"UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","row":["Horse Rescue Alliance",564,"Welcome to Horse Rescue Alliance 🐎\nWhere every hoofprint matters.\n\nAt Horse Rescue Alliance, we rescue, rehabilitate, and rehome horses in need—giving neglected, abandoned, and slaughter-bound equines a second chance at life. Based in Davie Fl, our mission is to provide safe haven, medical care, training, and love to horses who have suffered abuse, starvation, or abandonment.\n\nWe believe every horse deserves a life of dignity, and through our work, we strive to raise awareness about horse slaughter, neglect, and the importance of responsible ownership. On this channel, you’ll find:\n\n✨ Heartwarming rescue stories\n🐴 Before-and-after transformations\n🏡 Adoption success videos\n📚 Horse care tips & educational content\n📸 Behind-the-scenes of our daily rescue life\n\nSubscribe to join our herd and help us spread hope, healing, and compassion—one horse at a time.\n\n🌟 Let’s change lives together.\n#HorseRescue #AdoptDontShop #EquineWelfare #HorseRehab #HorseRescueAlliance","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:54.190Z","channelId":"UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e1f8a84995db31ca4f75293955838af952ed37f8769105deeb1e9ed2bb726311","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ebce62d5f33eea07cb149d046dfe9076aa5293045feefa2d33e31cf54d1c9f11"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":564,"raw":"564 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZY8jyaWDolqyWBf4wwCGkA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:54.190Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality